lls us  where we have some real disparity  between castle point and rockford  emma colby commented saying the data  reflects what we have noticed from our  calls  she also commented saying food banks  were probably quite a good opportunity  to introduce fruit and veg  but there are challenges around that  with storage  harriet pickering commented on this  saying that could be a really good  action if we could make it affordable  for families  where more families will be struggling  financially from covid  getting access to vegetables and that  being available could be a good thing  for all age groups  she also commented saying information  collated from the essex child and family  wellbeing service hubs  health visitors and school nurses might  add real strength to the start well  child and young people focus to bring in  some of that data and enrich the health  and well-being board  the key themes for this discussion are  community spirit and isolation

